{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14267","headline":"天津晓望因寄呈分司一二省郎 · 窦牟","name":"天津晓望因寄呈分司一二省郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万乘西都去，千门正位虚。\n凿龙横碧落，提象出华胥。\n望幸宫嫔老，迎春海燕初。\n保厘才半仗，容卫尽空庐。\n要自词难拟，繇来画不如。\n散郎无所属，聊事穆清居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}